Welcome to the compare~Groups Forum!

Soon we'll be kicking off this forum with a series of topics on the main features of the latest version (2.0) of compareGroups.
In the meantime, feel free to add yourself as a member of this forum (you can have new topics automatically emailed to you), or sign up for our main mailing list <http://eepurl.com/AOd-5> to receive general news about compareGroups. Of course, if you're already a compareGroups user and have a question or have found a bug, you can post it right now, and and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.

